00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Kangaroo Island is a drama, comedy film directed by Timothy David.

3
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:43,500
Lou Wells has hit rock bottom after a promising start to her Hollywood career.

4
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Now broke and aimless, she reluctantly accepts a plane ticket from her estranged father,
Rory to return home to South Australia’s ruggedly beautiful Kangaroo Island.

5
00:34:22,500 --> 00:34:28,500
As years of unresolved tension start to resurface, the reunion turns even more
complicated when Lou and her sister Freya learn about Rory’s secret.

6
