12
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
Kangaroo Island is a 2024 Australian drama/comedy film directed
by Timothy David and written by Sally Gifford.

13
01:29:22,500 --> 01:29:28,500
Its name derives from Kangaroo Island in South Australia, where it was filmed.

14
01:36:15,000 --> 01:36:21,000
Its world premiere was at the Adelaide Film Festival on 3 November 2024, and it
is scheduled for release in Australian cinemas on 21 August 2025.

15
01:43:07,500 --> 01:43:13,500
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
